  "instructions": [
    "1. In a blender, combine light coconut milk, peanut butter, satay sauce, sugar, ginger paste, and garlic. Blend until smooth.",
    "2. Heat vegetable oil in a pan over medium heat.",
    "3. Add shungiku greens to the pan and sauté until tender.",
    "4. Add the blended sauce to the pan and stir to combine.",
    "5. Cook for an additional 2-3 minutes.",
    "6. Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "7. Serve hot."
